   "In the Life Science and Physical Science lists, lecture and lab courses are printed as 'and' pairs (e.g., ANTH 300 and ANTH 301; ASTR C1001 and ASTR C1001L; GEOG/GEOL lecture and lab) that are taken together as one choice; recorded as separate entries. ANTH 480/482 (honors) recorded as alternatives to ANTH 300/301.",
